Kita mo? Aking Himalayan climbing tip.

00:40:14.058 --> 00:40:17.478
Kailangan mong kumain ng Dal bhāt
gamit ang iyong mga kamay, okay?

00:40:17.561 --> 00:40:18.812
Okay, naiintindihan ko.

00:40:20.189 --> 00:40:21.023
Hey.

00:40:22.149 --> 00:40:23.567
Aalis ka na agad?

00:40:25.027 --> 00:40:26.070
kailangan ko.

00:40:26.612 --> 00:40:28.614
Upang makita si Do-ha bago ako umalis,

00:40:28.697 --> 00:40:30.491
Mas mabuting maging abala ako.

00:40:36.747 --> 00:40:37.581
ikaw ba ay…

00:40:39.333 --> 00:40:40.292
